⍝ Runs every test suite (Tests/*Tests.apln) against APLSource.
⍝
⍝ Usage: dyalogscript Tests/run.apls [filter] [-slow]
⍝   filter  run only tests whose "Suite test name" contains this text,
⍝           ignoring case
⍝   -slow   include tests listed in a suite's Slow variable
⍝
⍝ Exits with code 1 if a file fails to load, or any test fails or errors.

⎕IO ⎕ML←1

args←2 ⎕NQ'.' 'GetCommandLineArgs'
testDir←⊃1 ⎕NPARTS⊃args
root←⊃1 ⎕NPARTS ¯1↓testDir
options←⎕NS''
options.slow←(⊂'-slow')∊1↓args
options.filter←{0=≢⍵:'' ⋄ ⊃⍵}(1↓args)~⊂'-slow'

Files←{{⍵[⍋⍵]}⊆⊃0(⎕NINFO⍠1)⍵}

loadErrors←0
∇ ref←Load file
  :Trap 0
      ref←⊃⎕FIX'file://',file
  :Else
      ref←⍬
      ⍞←'LOAD  ',file,': ',(⊃⎕DMX.DM),⎕UCS 10
      loadErrors+←1
  :EndTrap
∇

_←Load¨Files root,'APLSource/*.apln'
_←Load¨testDir∘,¨'Tester.apln' 'Helpers.apln'
suites←Load¨Files testDir,'*Tests.apln'
suites←(0≠≢¨suites)/suites

results←options Tester.Run suites
failed←(0<loadErrors)∨Tester.Failed results
⎕OFF(failed)
